# ─── Notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# data/opportunities.json IS committed on purpose: it is the dashboard's data
# source and the memory used to detect changes between runs. The same goes for
# data/sme_matches.json, which additionally carries the LLM evaluation cache —
# dropping it would make the next run pay for every company again.
# The web/public/data/ copies are the deployed mirrors, also committed.
# CV.pdf is committed only if you want the agent to run in CI — remove it here
# if you would rather keep it private and run the agent locally.
web/AGENTS.md
web/CLAUDE.md
